'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\13 - Recover Users
' Version    : 4.5.0 + unreleased addition (see CHANGELOG "Unreleased"; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents + BulkRegRecover)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegRecover (BR_RunRecover).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: first create the library BulkRegRecover (BulkRegRecover.lss). Then open this agent,
'              click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this WHOLE file, Ctrl+S.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (NOT 'All selected documents' - Designer's default - or Notes asks for a selected document)
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegRecover.lss header and SOP-recover-failed-users.md):
'
' Works ONLY from the Domino Directory (single source of truth) and the mail servers. Classifies every user,
' writes RECOVER_<run>_plan.csv, and (DryRun=0, type RECOVER) creates the missing mail files, replaces empty
' shells, then verifies them and requests the cluster replicas. Safe to run again at any time: it recomputes
' the plan every run and never overwrites a mail file. Registration of NOT_REGISTERED users stays with 02 + 03.
' Several machines: PartitionCount / PartitionIndex (same as 4.5.0) + a guard in the central log database.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegRecover"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunRecover()
End Sub
